The core_tools import was rewritten in tools/dance.py, tools/stop_dance.py,
tools/play_emotion.py, tools/stop_emotion.py, tools/move_head.py,
tools/sweep_look.py, and tools/head_tracking.py. The dance_emotion_moves
import was rewritten in moves.py, tools/dance.py, tools/play_emotion.py,
tools/move_head.py, and tools/sweep_look.py. No other imports were changed.

tools/_base.py is derived from the upstream ToolDependencies and Tool classes.
The original configuration, MCP integrations, tool-space and profile loading,
dynamic imports, and tool registries were removed.
